{"logId": "23ef8aa1-de43-47a2-961d-0d2f55909ad1", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "防盗", "block_bbox": [146, 189, 216, 221], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[146.0, 189.0], [216.0, 189.0], [216.0, 221.0], [146.0, 221.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "商品通过什么方式带出商场", "block_bbox": [133, 232, 380, 258], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[133.0, 232.0], [380.0, 232.0], [380.0, 258.0], [133.0, 258.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 将商品偷藏于自己衣服口袋、衣袖、袜子、内衣或随身带的包及其它物品里面然后出商场。", "block_bbox": [131, 267, 716, 322], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[131.0, 267.0], [716.0, 267.0], [716.0, 322.0], [131.0, 322.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 将商品拆去外包装，缩小体积进行收藏，然后出商场。", "block_bbox": [131, 336, 566, 362], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[131.0, 336.0], [566.0, 336.0], [566.0, 362.0], [131.0, 362.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 将商品在商场里面，当场消耗掉，比如吃或用掉。", "block_bbox": [132, 380, 531, 406], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[132.0, 380.0], [531.0, 380.0], [531.0, 406.0], [132.0, 406.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4. 将未付款的商品放进乔装打扮，装成一名孕妇或者大肚汉甚至其它形式到商场偷取一些便于收藏于身的商品，然后乘人不注意或难发觉将商品带出商场。", "block_bbox": [131, 425, 719, 515], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[131.0, 425.0], [719.0, 425.0], [719.0, 515.0], [131.0, 515.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5. 商场内部员工或者供应商在手续不全或根本无手续的情况下将商品带出商场。", "block_bbox": [131, 533, 716, 590], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[131.0, 533.0], [716.0, 533.0], [716.0, 590.0], [131.0, 590.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [730, 197, 1123, 560], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[730.0, 197.0], [1123.0, 197.0], [1123.0, 560.0], [730.0, 560.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "工作篇--人身伤害", "block_bbox": [94, 740, 309, 774], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[94.0, 740.0], [309.0, 740.0], [309.0, 774.0], [94.0, 774.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DL", "block_bbox": [121, 827, 192, 862], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 827.0], [192.0, 827.0], [192.0, 862.0], [121.0, 862.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四、人身伤害", "block_bbox": [147, 890, 287, 918], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[147.0, 890.0], [287.0, 890.0], [287.0, 918.0], [147.0, 918.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "案例：", "block_bbox": [172, 926, 226, 948], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[172.0, 926.0], [225.0, 926.0], [225.0, 947.0], [172.0, 947.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、2013年某天，三楼一专厅员工被打；", "block_bbox": [171, 954, 482, 978], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[171.0, 954.0], [482.0, 954.0], [482.0, 978.0], [171.0, 978.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、2014年某天，四楼一员工被打；", "block_bbox": [170, 984, 450, 1007], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[170.0, 984.0], [450.0, 984.0], [450.0, 1007.0], [170.0, 1007.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、2015年某天，三楼一专厅员工被打。", "block_bbox": [171, 1013, 477, 1037], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[171.0, 1013.0], [477.0, 1013.0], [477.0, 1037.0], [171.0, 1037.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "事后经核实，都是因为员工在外与别人有纠纷所导致。", "block_bbox": [182, 1043, 522, 1086], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 1043.0], [522.0, 1043.0], [522.0, 1086.0], [182.0, 1086.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [218, 1105, 483, 1314], "block_id": 16, "block_order": null, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1105.0], [483.0, 1105.0], [483.0, 1314.0], [218.0, 1314.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "处理方法：", "block_bbox": [677, 892, 767, 915], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[677.0, 892.0], [766.0, 892.0], [766.0, 914.0], [677.0, 914.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "①不要慌张，保护好自身安全，尽可能向人多或者有保安的地方跑；", "block_bbox": [676, 917, 1026, 966], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[676.0, 917.0], [1026.0, 917.0], [1026.0, 966.0], [676.0, 966.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "②如果对方拿有凶器（棍棒等），要做好自身防护，找能遮挡身体的合理位置；", "block_bbox": [677, 969, 1027, 1017], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[677.0, 969.0], [1027.0, 969.0], [1027.0, 1017.0], [677.0, 1017.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "③如脱不了身，喊救命，在能保护自身安全的同时尽量拖延对方，等待主管和保安的到来进行处理；", "block_bbox": [676, 1019, 1036, 1093], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[676.0, 1019.0], [1036.0, 1019.0], [1036.0, 1093.0], [676.0, 1093.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [706, 1103, 992, 1313], "block_id": 21, "block_order": null, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[706.0, 1103.0], [992.0, 1103.0], [992.0, 1313.0], [706.0, 1313.0]]}, {"block_label"