on_points": [[677.0, 892.0], [766.0, 892.0], [766.0, 914.0], [677.0, 914.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9013716578483582, "coordinate": [676, 917, 1026, 966], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[676.0, 917.0], [1026.0, 917.0], [1026.0, 966.0], [676.0, 966.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9049817323684692, "coordinate": [677, 969, 1027, 1017], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[677.0, 969.0], [1027.0, 969.0], [1027.0, 1017.0], [677.0, 1017.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9164553284645081, "coordinate": [676, 1019, 1036, 1093], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[676.0, 1019.0], [1036.0, 1019.0], [1036.0, 1093.0], [676.0, 1093.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9464557766914368, "coordinate": [706, 1103, 992, 1313], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[706.0, 1103.0], [992.0, 1103.0], [992.0, 1313.0], [706.0, 1313.0]]}, {"cls_id": 8, "label": "footer", "score": 0.8112261891365051, "coordinate": [95, 1476, 309, 1508], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[95.0, 1476.0], [309.0, 1476.0], [309.0, 1508.0], [95.0, 1508.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.7620465159416199, "coordinate": [939, 1332, 1121, 1376], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[939.0, 1332.0], [1121.0, 1332.0], [1121.0, 1376.0], [939.0, 1376.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 防盗\n\n## 商品通过什么方式带出商场\n\n1. 将商品偷藏于自己衣服口袋、衣袖、袜子、内衣或随身带的包及其它物品里面然后出商场。\n\n2. 将商品拆去外包装，缩小体积进行收藏，然后出商场。\n\n3. 将商品在商场里面，当场消耗掉，比如吃或用掉。\n\n4. 将未付款的商品放进乔装打扮，装成一名孕妇或者大肚汉甚至其它形式到商场偷取一些便于收藏于身的商品，然后乘人不注意或难发觉将商品带出商场。\n\n5. 商场内部员工或者供应商在手续不全或根本无手续的情况下将商品带出商场。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_730_197_1123_560.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"33%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 工作篇--人身伤害\n\n## DL\n\n## 四、 人身伤害\n\n案例：\n\n1、2013年某天，三楼一专厅员工被打；\n\n2、2014年某天，四楼一员工被打；\n\n3、2015年某天，三楼一专厅员工被打。\n\n事后经核实，都是因为员工在外与别人有纠纷所导致。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_218_1105_483_1314.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"22%\" /></div>\n\n\n处理方法：\n\n①不要慌张，保护好自身安全，尽可能向人多或者有保安的地方跑；\n\n②如果对方拿有凶器（棍棒等），要做好自身防护，找能遮挡身体的合理位置；\n\n③如脱不了身，喊救命，在能保护自身安全的同时尽量拖延对方，等待主管和保安的到来进行处理；\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_706_1103_992_1313.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"24%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_730_197_1123_560.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//23ef8aa1-de43-47a2-961d-0d2f55909ad1/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_730_197_1123_560.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A48Z%2F-1%2F%2Fac09165c0a90ec1876cc8ab454f4961671c3a9110da86a964e48b193fcf89bf1", "imgs/img_in_image_box_218_1105_483_1314.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//23ef8aa1-de43-47a2-961d-0d2f55909ad1/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_218_1105_483_1314.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A48Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb0fc32f86c935572bb1064a572d67afff9bd16aa0c91bb9ec644889f4f1b117b", "imgs/img_in_image_box_706_1103_992_1313.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//23ef8aa1-de43-47a2-961d-0d2f55909ad1/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_706_1103_992_1313.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A48Z%2F-1%2F%2F3fb3ba06cbdb8158389686886b9401e77291ca30637ee0d62a0604ed0b295ec1", "imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_939_1332_1121_1376.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//23ef8aa1-de43-47a2-961d-0d2f55909ad1/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_939_1332_1121_1376.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A48Z%2F-1%2F%2F27ce1aa73c56bc300e38649c2ef23b637fcf85e39fb96bd578fcebc8eb87ede9"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//23ef8aa1-de43-47a2-961d-0d2f55909ad1/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=